,\"title\":\"Chapter Five: Karma-yoga – Action in Kṛṣṇa Consciousness\"}],\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/29/\",\"bb\":1542,\"has_advanced_view\":false,\"pager\":{\"previous\":{\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/27-28/\",\"title\":\"TEXTS 27-28\",\"has_advanced_view\":false,\"translations\":[\"en\",\"cs\",\"es\",\"bg\",\"pt-br\",\"ru\",\"sk\",\"hr\",\"pl\",\"da\",\"de\",\"et\",\"fr\",\"hu\",\"ko\",\"lt\",\"nl\",\"sl\",\"uk\",\"ja\"]},\"next\":{\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/6/\",\"title\":\"Chapter Six\",\"has_advanced_view\":true,\"translations\":[\"en\",\"cs\",\"es\",\"bg\",\"pt-br\",\"ru\",\"sk\",\"hr\",\"pl\",\"da\",\"de\",\"et\",\"fr\",\"hu\",\"ko\",\"lt\",\"nl\",\"sl\",\"uk\",\"ja\"]}},\"child_items\":[{\"section\":\"devanagari\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.devanagari\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.DevanagariRecord\",\"title\":\"devanagari\",\"id\":1745,\"bb\":568107,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/29/devanagari/\",\"body_final\":\"भोक्तारं यज्ञतपसां सर्वलोकमहेश्वरम् ।
सुहृदं सर्वभूतानां ज्ञात्वा मां शान्तिमृच्छति ॥ २९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1746,\"bb\":1543,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/29/b1543/\",\"body_value\":\"bhoktāraṁ yajña-tapasāṁ
sarva-loka-maheśvaram
suhṛdaṁ sarva-bhūtānāṁ
jñātvā māṁ śāntim ṛcchati\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1747,\"bb\":1544,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/29/b1544/\",\"shadow_value\":\"bhoktāram – the beneficiary; yajña – of sacrifices; tapasām – and penances and austerities; sarva-loka – of all planets and the demigods thereof; mahā-īśvaram – the Supreme Lord; su-hṛdam – the benefactor; sarva – of all; bhūtānām – the living entities; jñātvā – thus knowing; mām – Me (Lord Kṛṣṇa); śāntim – relief from material pangs; ṛcchati – one achieves.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"bhoktāram\",\"translation\":\"the beneficiary\"},{\"word\":\"yajña\",\"translation\":\"of sacrifices\"},{\"word\":\"tapasām\",\"translation\":\"and penances and austerities\"},{\"word\":\"sarva-loka\",\"translation\":\"of all planets and the demigods thereof\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-īśvaram\",\"translation\":\"the Supreme Lord\"},{\"word\":\"su-hṛdam\",\"translation\":\"the benefactor\"},{\"word\":\"sarva\",\"translation\":\"of all\"},{\"word\":\"bhūtānām\",\"translation\":\"the living entities\"},{\"word\":\"jñātvā\",\"translation\":\"thus knowing\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me (Lord Kṛṣṇa)\"},{\"word\":\"śāntim\",\"translation\":\"relief from material pangs\"},{\"word\":\"ṛcchati\",\"translation\":\"one achieves\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1748,\"bb\":1545,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/5/29/b1545/\",\"body_value\":\"A person in full consciousness of Me, knowing Me to be the ultimate beneficiary of all sacrifices and austerities, the Supreme Lord of all planets and demigods, and the benefactor and well-wisher of all living entities, attains peace from the pangs of material miseries.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Reco